ble>\n</details>"},{"url":"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/1184#discussion_r3223294239","body":"### Missing `KeyEsc` alias in post-finish exit check\n\n**Low Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`isPostFinishExitKey` checks `tea.KeyEscape` but not `tea.KeyEsc`, while the main Escape handler on line 355 defensively checks both (`tea.KeyEscape || tea.KeyEsc`). If the two constants ever differ, an Esc press on the post-finish dashboard would skip the exit guard, fall into the main switch's Escape case (which is a no-op outside detail mode), and silently fail to quit.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 19bfeb3c-eda5-4c51-8ccf-0d830dca7d9a -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\ncmd/entire/cli/review/tui_model.go#L393-L402\ncmd/entire/cli/review/tui_model.go#L354-L355\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`cmd/entire/cli/review/tui_model.go#L354-L355`](https://github.com/entireio/cli/blob/c279308b22d7bc77a43ad2f580523023d302b3c1/cmd/entire/cli/review/tui_model.go#L354-L355)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?REDACTED\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?REDACTED\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\n\n<sup>